$w = 3.4
$h = 0.9
A: box wid $w ht $h fill 0xf4f4f4
B: box wid $w ht $h fill 0xe6e6e6 with .n at A.s
text "Client" bold with .w at A.w + (0.1, 0)
text "Server" bold with .w at B.w + (0.1, 0)
Q: box "Request" fit at A.c + (-0.4, 0)
R: box "Handle" fit at B.c + (0.6, 0)
arrow from Q.s down 0.2 then right 1.0 then to R.n
